      "en": "For as woman came from man, so a man also comes through a woman; but all things are from God.",
      "ko": "여자가 남자에게서 난것 같이 남자도 여자로 말미암아 났으나 모든것이 하나님에게서 났느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0a25674a29df3281de6322d42d3020ad7de5f932963ee4ed95f6c429a8428389",
      "translation_text_hash": "deef24bd468138a5858b339ad3caa0efd021b352b326030c5db0bf87a69993b1",
