      "en": "For I received from the Lord that which also I delivered to you, that the Lord Jesus on the night in which he was betrayed took bread.",
      "ko": "내가 너희에게 전한 것은 주께 받은 것이니 곧 주 예수께서 잡히시던 밤에 떡을 가지사",
      "source_text_hash": "e598f5cbcc085d9a854d000b55e5054497da0e8a0caad7577607daafe8b44d95",
      "translation_text_hash": "4feb62a1c87e4050d5d1fc011636ae52d22fe417d364175d83ffb4e302f48d42",
