      "en": "When he had given thanks, he broke it and said, “Take, eat. This is my body, which is broken for you. Do this in memory of me.”",
      "ko": "축사하시고 떼어 가라사대 이것은 너희를 위하는 내 몸이니 이것을 행하여 나를 기념하라 하시고",
      "source_text_hash": "a33edb0e840536fe1a072b64f0789022f0790de92a7ed674bd26239e756cb46a",
      "translation_text_hash": "6ac3a8403bb15e37535439882391d7bdeb36b1b1bab321bfe2692e085fd8129b",
